<title>GERMANY: TABLE-November German M3 growth drops to 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-November German M3 growth drops to 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank gave the following data for German M3 money supply growth in November</p>
<p>						  Nov 96	   Oct 96</p>
<p>Annualised vs average Q4 1995	    8.0		8.4</p>
<p>Note - The Bundesbank's target range for 1996 M3 money supply growth is four percent to seven percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
